WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:07.400
Raiou Girls Academy Dorm

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.050
C-Crap!

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.390
<i>My name is Ichina Saotome!</i>

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.100
<b>Cafeteria</b>

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:42.930
<i>A first-year student at Raiou Girls Academy, 
and a member of the golf club!</i>

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:47.090
<i>My dream is to become a top pro caddy.</i>

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:52.240
<i>Did you know that top pro 
caddies make a ton of money?</i>

00:00:53.350 --> 00:01:00.660
<i>A top caddy can make more money than 
some pro tour players will make!</i>

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:09.320
<i>So I'm going to Raiou Girls Academy 
to become a top pro caddy...</i>

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.790
It's gone!

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.840
T-That's my fifth tardy!

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:18.550
The older girls will get mad at me!

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.920
Saotome, what's wrong?

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.810
The bus already left.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.810
Shinjo!

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:32.270
Hi there.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.910
You're late again, Ichina?

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:37.780
Coach Amuro might kick you 
off the team at this rate!

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:41.340
I don't want him to punch me in the face!

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.720
Oh, Amawashi!

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:47.420
More importantly, about 
that practice match you had...

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.600
On the 2nd shot for the 6th hole,

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:53.160
I think you would've been better 
with the 7 Iron instead of the 8.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.280
I see!

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:01.050
You think my selections 
were less than optimal?

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:04.510
No, there was just 
a strong headwind that day,

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:07.760
so maybe a 7 would've been better... maybe.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.480
Thank you. I'll keep that in mind.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.480
Want a ride?

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.530
Aoi, we have a company meeting starting.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.990
Saotome, I'm sorry, but...

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.790
No, no. Go on ahead.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.010
It's my fault for being late.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.360
Sorry.

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.380
Get going.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:30.240
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:38.180
That was nerve-wracking. Amawashi's amazing.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:41.180
<i>She's totally bourgeoisie.</i>

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:44.010
<i>No sign of her, huh?</i>

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:46.760
Aoi, I'm starting the meeting.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.980
Okay, got it.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.490
<i>Ichina Saotome</i>

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.490
<i>Wants to Be a Pro Caddy!</i>

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.990
Raiou Girls Academy

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:28.410
They're going to make me 
clean the place for being late.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.410
Golf Club Building

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.690
I guess I'll get a head start.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:36.180
I do think that she should've used 
the 7 on the 2nd stroke of the 6th hole.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:39.460
The 7 would've gotten 
her right next to the pin.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.760
I agree.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.320
Right?

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:46.390
Well, the backside of the 
green on Hole 6 is a downslope.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:50.000
So taking the safe route 
with the 8 isn't an awful choice.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.340
But golf is about taking risks 
and being aggressive!

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:56.440
And getting better at aggression 
is the key to golf, I think!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:58.440
Gweh!

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.760
H-Haruka?

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.940
What was that "Gweh" for?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.520
W-What are you doing here?

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.810
Were you late?

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:10.480
You're late. I'm skipping.

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:15.120
The first-years spend all their time helping 
the older girls. We barely get to touch a club.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.820
There's no point in going to the course.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:21.740
<i>Haruka Misono, #3 in the 
country in middle school!</i>

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.680
<i>When she doesn't want to 
do something, she doesn't, I guess.</i>

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:28.120
Oh, if you're skipping, 
will you help me clean?

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:32.170
Ichina, be my caddy.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.520
No.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:39.770
<b>Practice Course</b>

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:38.940
I want your power to read 
the winds and the line.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:39.770
No.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.480
I want to beat Aoi Amawashi!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.530
Never happening.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:49.530
If you help me, this time 
I can beat Aoi Amawashi—

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.250
I said it's never happening.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.650
Why?

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:56.170
Drive distance. Precision. Putting.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:59.410
She's better than you in every aspect.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.950
Even if I was your caddy,

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:05.550
you're not strong enough 
to beat her right now.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.110
T-That was dangerous!

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:21.820
Who the hell was that?

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:26.870
It went past the bunker,

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:29.810
so that's at least 240 yards...

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:30.640
And...

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.820
<i>That low, precise trajectory...</i>

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:35.240
<i>I've never seen anything like it!</i>

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.790
<i>So it's not somebody from the golf club.</i>

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.850
<i>Who fired that shot?</i>

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:53.920
<i>A blonde?!</i>

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.520
Are you from here?

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:00.770
I asked if you're from here.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.190
Do you understand what I'm saying?

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:06.440
Um, I'm still studying English.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.100
You from around here?

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:13.710
You can speak Japanese?

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:18.200
I guess I can. Why, I wonder?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.870
Hey, that was dangerous!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.750
You saw we were in the bunker, didn't you?

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:25.720
Yeah.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.720
I was too lazy to go all the way over there,

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.660
so I figured I could get 
your attention this way.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:31.550
You're crazy.

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:32.960
Anyway...

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.840
Do that again!

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.880
Ichina, what are you saying?

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:40.380
I want to see your tee shot! Please!

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:42.960
Please!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.770
Okay, I guess...

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.640
The whole team should be 
at the course today...

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:58.120
You just want to see my shot, right?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.620
Yes. As hard as you can!

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:05.000
<i>Why am I doing what she wants me to?</i>

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.010
<i>Oh, I get it.</i>

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.980
<i>She reminds me of Lily.</i>

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:13.520
<i>If you want to see it that bad...</i>

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:16.310
<i>I'll show it to you!</i>

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.450
<i>Wow...</i>

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:26.550
<i>What is this shot?</i>

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.780
That trajectory...

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:35.390
Good enough?

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.760
Wow! Wow! Wow!

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.980
That's pro-level!

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:43.600
And you're physically strong! 
Look at those abs!

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:47.030
And your subscapularis 
and gluteus medius are so soft!

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.750
So supple!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:53.170
You've got the ideal body to play golf!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.930
I'm in love!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.080
Get off me!

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:59.730
I want to touch them! I want to touch them!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.360
Are you a pervert?

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:04.990
By the way, who are you?

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:07.470
Outsiders aren't allowed 
inside the school...

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:09.300
I came to see Aoi Amawashi.

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.730
Amawashi?

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.650
I looked her up online.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.870
She's here, isn't she?

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:21.200
S-She's a student here, yes.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.040
What do you want with her?

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:26.550
I came to fulfill my promise.

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:28.550
And continue our game.

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:30.920
Continue your game?

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.100
Where is she?

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:33.540
You.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.550
What are you doing here?

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.050
C-Club President Jinguuji?

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.420
U-Um, well...

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:44.150
She was just out here golfing, and um...

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:49.070
I-I don't know why, but she says 
she's here to see Amawashi.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.560
What's your name?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.730
Evangeline F... Kimishima?

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.840
Just call me Eve.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.360
Raiou Girls Academy is off limits

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:06.240
to anyone not affiliated with the school, 
no matter what their reasons may be.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:08.000
Leave. Now.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.300
I will, once I see Aoi.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:13.000
Do you not speak Japanese?

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:17.180
If you want to try force 
to get rid of me, go for it.

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:19.180
I love that stuff.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:22.130
How dare you act like that to Jinguuji?

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:23.920
No violence!

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.320
You want to see her that bad?

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.180
I promised her.

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:33.640
Then play a 1 hole match with Misono.

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:37.050
If you win, I'll let you see her.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:40.480
Sounds great. I really love that stuff.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.950
J-Jinguuji, why me?

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.830
Misono, if you win this match,

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.720
I'll use my authority as club 
president to make you a regular.

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:54.240
If you hate picking up balls 
and carrying the older girls' bags,

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.720
show me what you can do.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:59.960
If I win, you'll make me 
a regular for real, right?

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.720
Are you accusing me of being a liar?

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:04.810
I'll do it!

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.560
I'll win!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.850
You've got spirit.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.280
Club President!

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:13.540
Haruka's used to this practice hole, 
but Eve hasn't played it before.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:17.150
So may I be her caddy?

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:18.710
Well?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.770
I'm fine with that.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:27.010
But if I win, you'll be my personal caddy.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:27.820
Okay?

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.120
F-Fine.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.490
That's okay.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:34.600
Eve, we've gotta to win!

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:36.710
Let's work together for victory!

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.740
I don't need a caddy!

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:43.280
No...! I already promised!

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.310
That's not my problem.

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.170
Aww!

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:54.950
Nice shot!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.820
Nice shot!

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:05.250
You've been making a lot 
of little mistakes lately, Aoi.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.500
Fix that.

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.200
I'm sorry, Amane.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.490
I'll do my best.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:13.260
<i>She's losing her motivation.</i>

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:16.000
<i>It's probably that girl...</i>

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:22.430
We'll start the 1 hole match. 
Misono has honor.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.480
Okay!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.620
<i>I don't care how far you can hit the ball.</i>

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:31.010
<i>Golf's about more than just drive distance.</i>

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:34.320
<i>Especially since this is my home ground.</i>

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:39.980
<i>There's no way I can lose!</i>

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.450
<i>Perfect!</i>

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:52.950
<i>Just under 200 yards. 
And near the best possible distance.</i>

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:55.120
<i>She'll use a #3 for her next shot.</i>

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.040
<i>So it's a question of how 
close she can get to the green.</i>

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:03.010
<b>Eve</b>

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:03.010
<b>Haruka</b>

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:02.960
<i>Eve can hit 240, based off 
that tee shot I just saw.</i>

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.770
<i>So her best position is...</i>

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:06.760
<i>Wait!</i>

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.600
She's already at address!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.470
<i>Direct strike...</i>

00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:14.600
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:23.880
Well? Got a problem?

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.340
No, none!

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.200
That's perfect!

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:32.600
So perfect I'm starting 
to wonder what I'm good for.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.870
Oh, uh. Sorry...

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:38.520
<i>G-Golf's not about drive distance!</i>

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:39.880
<i>It's precision!</i>

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:43.170
<i>I'm not so sure.</i>

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:46.880
<i>The farther your drive off the tee,</i>

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.680
<i>the easier your second shot will be.</i>

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:51.420
<i>That's right.</i>

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.600
<i>Drive distance is a critical aspect of golf.</i>

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.120
<i>Let's see what she can do 
with this second shot.</i>

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:06.230
Hey...

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:08.600
Use the 6.

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:10.480
You're sure to get close to the pin.

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:13.140
If you want to be my caddy,

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.290
learn about how I play golf first.

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:19.720
How you play golf?

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:20.640
Yup.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:23.460
My golf is a rainbow bullet.

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:28.140
This is the red bullet...

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.480
Fire!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.140
<i>This shot...</i>

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:37.140
<i>What's with that angle?</i>

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.320
<i>She shoots it straight up into the sky...</i>

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:45.020
<i>And then I aim for the pin from above.</i>

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:45.990
<i>This is my...</i>

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:49.420
<i>Heaven's red bullet!</i>

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:56.240
You almost got an eagle! Wow!

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:57.500
It's not amazing.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.040
At times like this, you say

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.920
"Almost had it!"

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:06.050
It's not over yet. I still have my putt.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.480
Good work.

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.050
That wasn't even "work".

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.760
Let's see what you can do.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.340
<i>I can do this.</i>

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:21.310
<i>I've practiced this course so many times.</i>

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:24.400
<i>Slice on the upside, hook on the down.</i>

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.160
<i>It's fine.</i>

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:27.950
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.990
<i>Pathetic.</i>

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:35.020
<i>Just two shots have thrown her off her game.</i>

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:41.070
<i>Two cups to the left... no, one.</i>

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.990
<i>No... a little more...</i>

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:47.800
<i>The line's blurring! I can't see it!</i>

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:54.280
1.5 to the left.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:58.440
If you use 60% of your strength, it'll go in.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:00.770
Ichina...

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.570
I'm not lying.

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:05.130
The rest is up to your skill as a golfer.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:13.320
You're a nice girl.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.920
Nope.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:21.240
I just want to show you as much 
of my power as a caddy as possible.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:23.880
My ability to read the line.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.310
<i>1.5 cups to the left.</i>

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.500
<i>60% of my power.</i>

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:41.800
She missed.

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:44.930
It's Haruka's fault for not 
being able to pull it off!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:46.640
I was right!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:49.120
Well, I don't care which.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:53.880
I won.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.910
Can I see Aoi now?

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:59.150
Of course. I'll keep my promise.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:01.410
She should be here.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.060
Eve!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.960
Eve!

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:14.310
Eve!

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.530
Eve!

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:18.480
Aoi!

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.670
Why did you jump?

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.400
I'm not sure...

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.640
When did you get to Japan?

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:34.320
Today.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.240
You haven't logged into the game at all.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.710
I thought you broke your promise again.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:42.760
Oh, um... sorry.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.200
A lot's happened.

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:47.540
Fine. I forgive you.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.130
Thanks.

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.760
So, where are you staying?

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:52.880
I haven't decided yet.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:55.930
You can stay in my room, then!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:56.980
No thank you!

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:58.750
Do you hate me?

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:00.610
I don't like you or hate you.

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.150
That's so mean!

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:04.730
Is this who Aoi actually is?

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:04.720
I can find my own room!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:06.680
You can't! It'll be really hard!

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.360
Why don't you have a plan?

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:10.030
I can't believe she came to Japan.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:11.970
That's her.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.640
Coach.

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:19.960
The girl who appeared in the last day 
of the Nafrece U15 Women's Championship.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.440
Her name was...

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.600
Eve Aleon, is that right?

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:30.370
For some reason, she's now 
Evangeline F. Kimishima.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:34.240
You had her play a match 
to see what she could do, right?

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.190
Yes.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:41.800
And she crushed Haruka Misono, 
the first year, is that right?

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.510
It's too early to start being cocky.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.880
What did the doctors say?

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:51.660
Two months for a full recovery.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.530
That's not good.

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:58.940
Come on, Eve! My room's this way!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.970
W-What about our game?

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:04.120
Practice is done for today, 
so let's do it tomorrow.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.090
Amane will yell at me again 
if I disobey orders.

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:08.960
H-Hey!

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.170
Just come on!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.920
No, seriously...

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:15.240
W-Who's the blonde?

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.840
Seems like somebody Amawashi knows.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.370
Shinjo.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:23.960
Um, who is Eve?

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.420
I can't say.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:28.130
Some things even I don't know.

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:29.560
I see...

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:33.050
<i>This is how Eve and I met.</i>

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:39.380
<i>The day that was the beginning 
of my becoming a true pro caddie.</i>

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:49.360
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.320
Hey, Eve?

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:55.090
How long are you going to be in Japan?

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:56.560
I haven't decided.

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:59.010
Taking a solo vacation?

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.060
Nope.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:02.810
It's complicated. 
I can't go back to Nafrece.

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.600
What do you mean?

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.720
I can't say why.

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:09.870
What about your family?

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:11.140
I don't have any.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:14.820
I see... I see.

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:18.920
<i>Klein, Lily, and the others...</i>

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:20.940
<i>Are they doing well?</i>

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:40.090
Hey, Eve,

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:45.360
if you don't have anywhere to go, 
I have a suggestion...

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:47.140
First, our game!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:49.760
P-Put some clothes on!

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.840
Let's go out and play right now!

00:20:52.110 --> 00:20:53.540
Put some clothes on!

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.910
Why do you think I came to Japan?

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:58.230
Clothes! Put on some clothes!

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:00.860
I'm seeing things I shouldn't see!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.150
I don't care!

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:04.360
<i>Things keep getting worse...</i>

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:04.980
Come on!

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:41.310
Bye!

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:42.470
Bye!

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:46.120
Study hard, kiddos!

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:47.570
Okay!

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:49.500
What will we do today?

00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:50.920
What will we do?

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:52.360
Sheesh.

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:54.690
It's too early in the morning 
for that level of noise.

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:57.030
They like going to school.

00:22:57.840 --> 00:23:00.940
I wouldn't go if you asked me to!

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:06.660
Hey, do you think Eve made it to Japan?

00:23:06.960 --> 00:23:08.190
It's fine.

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:09.700
She's not a kid anymore.

00:23:10.730 --> 00:23:14.300
What's she doing now, I wonder?

00:23:17.240 --> 00:23:20.660
So this is sudden, but we 
have a new transfer student.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:23.410
Can you introduce yourself?

00:23:23.720 --> 00:23:26.230
Um...

00:23:26.230 --> 00:23:30.290
I'm Evangeline F. Kimi... shima.

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:31.130
Nice to meet you all.

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:34.520
Shh! Be quiet!

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:38.720
<i>Really, what am I doing?</i>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:50.020
Next Episode

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:41.680
Sorry, Eve!

00:23:41.680 --> 00:23:43.830
I'd love to have our match, 
but I'm really busy!

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:46.490
Amawashi. I, Ichina Saotome, 
am the main character!

00:23:46.490 --> 00:23:48.000
More Birdie Birdie next week!

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:50.000
That's <i>my</i> line!
